  "summary": "<p>President Donald J. Trump is delivering on his promise to restore law and order. According to the DOJ’s National Crime Victimization Survey, violent crime PLUMMETED in 2025 under President Trump compared to 2024 and the lawlessness Americans witnessed during the Biden Administration. Under President Trump, Americans have seen the largest one-year reduction in violent crime [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/new-survey-president-trump-delivers-historic-drop-in-violent-crime/\">NEW SURVEY: President Trump Delivers Historic Drop in Violent Crime</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
