t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">President Donald J. Trump is delivering on his promise to restore law and order. According to the <a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/TA2FtW6Kzcq?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOJ’s National Crime Victimization Survey</a>, violent crime PLUMMETED in 2025 under President Trump compared to 2024 and the lawlessness Americans witnessed during the Biden Administration. <strong>Under President Trump, Americans have seen the largest one-year reduction in violent crime in the report’s history. </strong><br><br>This is the direct result of having President Trump at the helm— a leader who respects LAW AND ORDER and puts the safety and security of the American people first.  After securing the border, deporting dangerous criminal illegal aliens, respecting our law enforcement officers, and cracking down on drug trafficking, crime is dropping at a historic rate. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Meanwhile, as President Trump makes our communities safer, Radical Democrats continue to put criminals over law-abiding Americans, backing policies like cashless bail, abolishing prisons, open borders, and dangerous sanctuary city policies that threaten public safety. <br><br>The results prove that President Trump and Republicans are delivering safer streets, where Radical Democrats delivered lawlessness, open borders and no respect for the rule of law in this country. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"737\" height=\"316\" src=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-27-140650.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-53540\" style=\"width:782px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-27-140650.png 737w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-27-140650.png?resize=600,257 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 737px) 100vw, 737px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"h-delivering-tax-relief-for-hardworking-mississippians\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><strong><u>CRIME PLUMMETS ACROSS AMERICA UNDER PRESIDENT TRUMP:</u></strong></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>NON-FATAL VIOLENT CRIME&nbsp;<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/oqSH1MJLHFT?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOWN 25%</a>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>AGGRAVATED ASSAULT <a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/fUPjFlcoaol?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOWN 31%</a></strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>ROBBERIES <a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/kDvWGY4sMSL?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOWN 27%&nbsp;</a></strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>BURGLARY AND TRESPASSING <a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/ya4LeNMERSN?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOWN 25%&nbsp;</a></strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>MOTOR VEHICLE THEFT <a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/mf2LExIczfo?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOWN 30%</a>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>PROPERTY CRIME <a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/VswhfK3IZpu?e=e070a83827&amp;c2id=b10bf9502296de100c94915c3befd22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DOWN 19%</a>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These dramatic declines demonstrate the impact of President Trump’s commitment to cracking down on crime, holding criminals accountable, and making American communities safer.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/new-survey-president-trump-delivers-historic-drop-in-violent-crime/\">NEW SURVEY: President Trump Delivers Historic Drop in Violent Crime</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
